<p><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">Milwaukee County&nbsp;&nbsp;}&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_Address_Line_1]]</span>,&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_Number]]</span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_City_Address]]</span>,&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_State_Address]]</span>&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_PostalCode_Address]]</span></span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">This notice terminates your tenancy pursuant to §704.17 (1) or (2)(a) and/or (2)(b), Wisconsin Statutes and requires you to vacate the premises described in this notice within&nbsp;5 days&nbsp;from service hereof&nbsp;unless you pay&nbsp;the total unpaid rent of<strong> <u><span contenteditable="false">[[Rent_Balance]]</span></u></strong>&nbsp;which was due on&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Lease_Rent_Due_Day]]</span>&nbsp;day of <span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Month]]</span>&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Year]]</span>.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">Description of premises:&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_Address_Line_1]]</span>,&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_Number]]</span>,&nbsp;Milwaukee WI&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Unit_PostalCode_Address]]</span>.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">The amount was calculated as follows:</span></span></p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 700px">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Month]]</span>&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Year]]</span>&nbsp;unpaid rent</span></span></td>
