			<td><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">Amount required to avoid eviction (excludes late fees)</span></span></td>
			<td><u><strong><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span contenteditable="false">[[Rent_Balance]]</span></span></span></strong></u></td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

<p><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>Note</strong>: The above amount required to avoid eviction&nbsp;excludes&nbsp;unpaid late fees,&nbsp;if any. To have a zero balance, you must pay the total amount due.</span></span></p>

<p><br>
<span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">Dated at Milwaukee, WI 53224, this&nbsp;<u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</u>&nbsp;day of&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Month]]</span>&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Year]]</span></span></span></p>

<p><br>
<span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>Landlord / Landlord''s Agent:</strong></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span contenteditable="false">[[Rental_Owner_Full_Name]]</span>&nbsp;/ Albert Harris</span></span></p>

