<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">This is a 12-hour notice as required by law</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">We will be entering your rental unit 12 hours after the above date and time. Our entry will be at any time between the hours of <u><strong>10:00 a.m. and 1:00 p.m. on&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></u>. The purpose of our entry is to:</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ***&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)">Perform property inspection</span></strong></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *</span></span><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)">**&nbsp; Section 11 of the lease: Tenant shall maintain the Premises under&nbsp;Tenant''s control in a <u><strong>clean manner</strong></u> and in as good of a general condition as it was at the beginning of the term</span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ***&nbsp;&nbsp;Tenant agrees to <u><strong>keep the rental unit in a clean</strong></u>, safe, and sanitary condition and not litter the property.</span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">NOTE:</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><strong>Tenants don''t have any rights to deny the landlord entry</strong>, if the landlord has given proper notice.<br>
<strong>Tenants cannot require that the tenant be there during the time that the landlord has chosen to enter</strong>.&nbsp;A tenant isn''t allowed to say, "I have to be here in order for you to come in." If the tenant happens to be there during the time that the landlord has chosen to enter, it''s perfectly allowable under these laws for the tenant to stay.<br>
<strong>A landlord cannot require that a tenant NOT be there during the time that the landlord has chosen to enter</strong>.&nbsp;Similar to the above point, a landlord doesn''t have the right to tell the tenant that they may not be in their home during the landlord''s entry.</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">If you should have any questions or concerns or agrees to the landlord entering the unit at an earlier time please contact us at:</span></span></p>

<div>&nbsp;</div>', array['Current_Date', 'Lease_All_Tenants', 'Unit_Address_Line_1', 'Unit_City_Address', 'Unit_PostalCode_Address', 'Unit_State_Address']::text[]) on conflict (buildium_id) do update set html = excluded.html, fields = excluded.fields, subject = excluded.subject, description = excluded.description;
insert into letter_templates (buildium_id, recipient, name, subject, description, html, fields) values ('20902', 'Tenant', '24 Hour Breach', null, 'Changing Locks', '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:1.5em">24 HOUR NOTICE TO CORRECT BREACH OR VACATE PREMISES</span></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:1.5em">24 Hour Notice Wis Statues &sect;704.17 (1)</span></p>

<p><br />
<span style="font-size:1.5em"><span class="token" contenteditable="false">[[Rental_Owner_Full_Name]]</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:1.5em">414 S 2ND ST&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MILWAUKEE WI 53204</span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:1.5em"><span class="token" contenteditable="false">[[Lease_All_Tenants]]</span></span></p>

