<span style="font-size: 1.5em"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif">Dated at Milwaukee, WI 53154, this&nbsp;<u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;day of&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Month]]</span>&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Year]]</span></span></span></p>

