<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">This notice terminates your tenancy at the above address pursuant to<strong> §704.17(2)(b), Wisconsin Statutes,</strong> and requires you to vacate the premises described in this notice within<strong> five (5) days</strong> from the service hereof , <strong>UNLESS </strong>you remedy the violations described below not later than five (5) days after this notice has been served upon you.</span></span></p>

