<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><strong>Total Amount Due</strong> to Cure Financial Breach: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</u></strong></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><strong>Non-Waiver</strong>: If you make a payment of less than the&nbsp;<u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;required by this notice, you will still be in default and <strong>SUBJECT TO EVICTION</strong>.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><strong>Credit Reporting</strong>: We may report delinquent accounts to credit bureaus. This may affect your ability to obtain credit and/or your ability to rent in the future.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><strong>Double Rent</strong>: Wisconsin law §704.27 provides that an owner can recover a minimum of twice the daily rent amount for the time the tenant remains in possession of the unit after expiration of this notice.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><strong>Liability for Damages</strong>:&nbsp;Please take notice that under the terms of your lease and Wisconsin law, you are financially responsible for any property damage caused by unauthorized animals. This includes, but is not limited to, costs for professional cleaning, deodorizing, carpet replacement, subfloor treatment, and drywall repair necessary to restore the premises to its original condition.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em"><strong>Arrangements</strong>: Payment of the breach charge can be made through your <strong>Tenant Portal</strong>.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 1.5em">Dated at Milwaukee, WI 53224, <span contenteditable="false">[[Current_Date]]</span></span></span></p>

