			<p><strong><span style="font-family: times new roman, serif; font-size: 16px">To</span></strong><span style="font-family: times new roman, serif; font-size: 16px">:</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 297pt">
			<p><span style="font-family: times new roman, serif; font-size: 16px"><span contenteditable="false">[[Tenant_First_Name]]</span>&nbsp;<span contenteditable="false">[[Tenant_Last_Name]]</span>, and All Occupants.</span></p>
